WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.846
Thirty participants took part,

00:00:01.926 --> 00:00:06.212
all experienced Python programmers at a large US
technology company,

00:00:06.292 --> 00:00:09.936
each paid fifty dollars for roughly an hour of their time.

00:00:10.016 --> 00:00:14.688
Every person solved three coding problems drawn
from LeetCode's easy tier,

00:00:14.768 --> 00:00:16.678
with a ten-minute cap per task,

00:00:16.758 --> 00:00:21.879
and could run their code and a set of provided unit
tests to debug along the way.

00:00:21.959 --> 00:00:27.722
Task order and which tool went with which task were
randomized to keep the comparison fair.

00:00:27.802 --> 00:00:32.730
The edit model itself was trained earlier, on a
separate group of nine coders.
